   "case_id": "F-02",
   "arm": "single",
   "n_codes": 4,
   "reply": "Hi, thanks for raising ticket TCK-7002.\n\nERR-4005 means Migration halted because usage spiked above the guardrail. Wait for the hourly window to close, then clear the halt from Billing then Advanced then Resume.\n\nERR-4114 means Request used a /v2 path that does not exist. Use the /v1 path. Ledger v2 is served from /v1.\n\nERR-4216 means Sync ran while the invoice was being edited. No action needed. The next hourly sweep picks it up.\n\nERR-4502 means Tax authority endpoint was unreachable during the sweep. No action needed. The sweep retries the unreachable authority on the next daily run.\n\n[ESCALATED]\n\nBest regards,\nBilling Support",
   "answered": true,
   "terminated": null,
