   "reply": "Hi, thanks for raising ticket TCK-7003.\n\nERR-4001 means Workspace has an open dispute on a legacy invoice. Resolve or withdraw the dispute in Billing then Disputes, then re-queue the migration.\n\nERR-4033 means Duplicate token created because a manual re-queue raced the automatic retry chain. Delete the newer of the two tokens in the provider dashboard, then let the automatic chain finish. Do not delete the older token.\n\nERR-4212 means Invoice is still open in Ledger v1. No action needed. Only closed invoices are synced; it will copy after it closes.\n\nERR-4303 means Subscription references a plan that was archived in v1. Un-archive the plan, migrate, then re-archive it.\n\nERR-4503 means Exemption certificate has expired. Collect a new certificate and upload it in Billing then Tax then Certificates. The customer is taxable until it is uploaded.\n\nBest regards,\nBilling Support",
