   "reply": "Hi, thanks for raising ticket TCK-7004.\n\nERR-4002 means Organisation owner account is unverified. Have the owner complete email verification, then retry from the Migration panel.\n\nERR-4030 means Card network declined the tokenisation request. Ask the customer to re-enter the card in Billing then Payment methods; the old vault entry cannot be recovered.\n\nERR-4110 means Webhook endpoint returned a non-2xx during the post-cutover flush. No action needed for the first six hours; the flush retries with backoff. After six hours, replay from Developers then Webhooks then Replay.\n\nERR-4211 means Line item references a product SKU that no longer exists in v2. Map the retired SKU to its v2 replacement in Settings then Catalogue then SKU mapping, then retry.\n\nERR-4302 means Billing anchor is the 31st and the workspace migrated during a short month. No action needed at migration time. To restore the original anchor afterwards, file a ticket; the anchor cannot be reset from the UI.\n\nERR-4504 means Customer address is in a jurisdiction that v2 does not yet support. File a ticket. The customer is billed without tax until the jurisdiction is enabled.\n\n[ESCALATED]\n\nBest regards,\nBilling Support",
